Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|
		|siteName|Site Name|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Access Staging
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|password|password|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role add
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTROL_PANEL_SITES_SITES_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_SITE_VIEW_STAGING_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|View Staging|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role assign Reg Role CP
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Members
		|portlet|Site Memberships|
	And Site assign User As Member CP
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|password|test|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging view Staging Local Live PG
	Then User logout And Login PG
		|password|test|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|test test|
